<div class="page-heading admin-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Communication</span><h1>Email delivery log</h1><p>Local previews and production SMTP delivery results.</p></div><div class="heading-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="<?= url('admin/settings') ?>">SMTP settings</a></div></div><div class="report-notice"><span>i</span><p>With <b>MAIL_DRIVER=log</b>, messages are stored here instead of leaving the server. Switch to authenticated SMTP and test delivery before launch.</p></div><section class="card mail-list"><?php if(!$messages):?><div class="empty-state"><span>✉</span><h2>No email messages yet</h2><p>Verification, recovery and notification emails will appear here.</p></div><?php endif?><?php foreach($messages as $message):?><details><summary><span class="mail-status <?= e($message['status']) ?>">●</span><div><b><?= e($message['subject']) ?></b><small>To <?= e($message['recipient']) ?> · <?= format_date($message['created_at'],true) ?></small></div><span class="status-pill status-<?= e($message['status']) ?>"><?= e(ucfirst($message['status'])) ?></span><i>⌄</i></summary><div class="mail-preview"><?= $message['body_html'] ?></div></details><?php endforeach?></section>
